        "accordion_67RMgq": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Deep Dive Hydrator</strong></p><p>Squalane, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Oil, Dextrin Palmitate, Plukenetia Volubilis (Sacha Inchi) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Padina Pavonica Thallus Extract, Bacillus Ferment, Tocopherol</p><p><strong>Peak Performance Sun Stick:</strong></p><p><strong>Active Ingredient:<br/></strong>Zinc Oxide (non-nano): Zinc Oxide 25%</p><p><strong>Inactive ingredients:</strong><br/>Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax, Isoamyl Laurate, Ethylhexyl Olivate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, C13-15 Alkane, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Oryza Sativa (Rice Bran) Oil, Quaternium-90 Bentonite, Capryloyl Glycerin/Sebacic Acid Copolymer, Prototheca Moriformis (Microalgae) Oil, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Butter, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Triethyl Citrate, Squalane, Physalis Angulata (Ground Cherry) Extract, Rhododendron Ferrugineum (Alpenrose) Extract, Undaria Pinnatifida (Wakame) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Laurel Lysine, Tocopherol Acetate,  Tocopherol</p><p></p><p></p><p>See for more information on our <a href=\"/pages/ingredients\" title=\"Ingredients\">ingredients page</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_qjkDHd": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Use",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Deeper Dive Moisturizer:</strong></p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong><br/>After AM/PM cleansing, or when you wash yourself after a workout session, apply one pump amount into hands and gently rub onto face, neck and chest if applicable. For optimal results use in the AM and PM.</p><p><strong>Step 2:<br/></strong>If heading outside apply Peak Performance SPF50 Sun Stick as the final step in your daily routine.</p><p>Reapply after 80 min of swimming or sweating, immediately after towel drying and at least every 2 hours when exposed to the sun. </p><p>Product can be re-applied over or under makeup. </p>"
          }
        },
